    "chunk_text": ", ac \u00f0a toweardan ende nabba\u00fe. Ne n\u00e6niges mannes lif ne bi\u00f0 to \u00fean lange \u00fe\u00e6t on sceortre & on sarigre hwile ne geendige. For \u00f0an sare & eallum \u00f0am unrotnessum on \u00feysse worulde we beo\u00f0 gen\u00e6tte. N\u00e6nig ne sie se \u00f0e ne sarige his synna, & wepan he sceal & hreowsian \u00fe\u00e6t he ne scyle on ecnesse Us gedafna\u00f0 \u00feurh manigfealde earfe\u00f0nessa to ganganne on heofena rice. Lytle synt \u00feas l\u00e6nendlican earfo\u00f0nessa \u00fey we nu ar\u00e6fnan magon for \u00fe\u00e6s lufan, & mycle synt \u00fea meda Swa mycle swi\u00f0or swa we nu beo\u00f0 n\u00e6tte on \u00feyssum life, swa mycle ma we feoga\u00f0 on \u00f0am toweardan For \u00f0an symle God her wunda\u00f0 & swing\u00f0 \u00f0a \u00fee he wile habban & to \u00feam ecan life gel\u00e6dan. Swa swa gold on ofne he hie sy\u00f0 & costa\u00f0, & swa ons\u00e6gdnesse he hie onfeh\u00f0. For \u00f0an ne sceal nan man gnornigan on his untrumnesse, ne cwe\u00f0an: For hwan ar\u00e6fne ic \u00f0as yfel o\u00f0\u00f0e Wa la, to hwan \u00ferowige ic \u00feis? Ac ma \u00f0u scealt cwe\u00f0an: Dryhten, \u00fee ic syngode, swa mycel ic ne gefele swa ic wyr\u00f0e eom. Se \u00f0e gnorna\u00f0 on his untrumnesse, God he tyrg\u00f0 & his yrre he awec\u00f0. & se \u00f0e hit ge\u00feyldlice abere\u00f0, God li\u00f0e he awaca\u00f0 to him. Ge\u00feenc nu \u00f0u, man, \u00feonne \u00f0u sie cwylmed on \u00feyssum middangearde on \u00feinum untrymnesse, beheald \u00deonne",
